{"id":437,"date":"2023-01-25T14:41:40","date_gmt":"2023-01-25T14:41:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/personal-banking\/banking\/lending\/home-loans\/home-equity-loans-lines-of-credit\/"},"modified":"2023-04-27T14:56:28","modified_gmt":"2023-04-27T14:56:28","slug":"home-equity-loans-lines-of-credit","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/home-equity-loans-lines-of-credit\/","title":{"rendered":"Home Equity Loans\/Lines of Credit"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Home equity loans and lines of credit<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for an affordable way to borrow? Using a home equity loan or home equity line of credit (HELOC) enables a homeowner to borrow against a home\u2019s equity for major expenses, like home improvements, debt consolidation, education or medical care, and they offer some of the lowest rates available.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group is-style-testimonial\">\n<p><strong>It was a display of THE finest, friendliest service I have ever encountered with any business, anywhere. With all the electronic methods used to communicate these days, the loan originator kept me informed each day. She was really beyond a professional, and seemed honestly interested in how she could help me all along the way\u2026 the Bank will always have my business.<\/strong><br><em>&#8211; Kenneth<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-dark\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GET STARTED<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Already started? <a href=\"https:\/\/idp.elliemae.com\/authorize?client_id=srtrz0d2&amp;site_id=8456065592&amp;response_type=code&amp;redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fchelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com%2Fborrower-app%2Flogin%2F%3FsiteId%3D8456065592&amp;scope=ccbp%20cc&amp;instance_id=be11173852&amp;logo_url=https%3A%2F%2Fasset-service-bucket-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f374b2c-540b-416f-a899-84ca75e40a3f&amp;logo_alt_text=Logo&amp;bust=198&amp;apiBaseUrl=https:\/\/api.elliemae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Complete your application<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-light-orange-background-color has-background\"><strong>Fixed Rate Home Equity Loan<\/strong> \u2014 Looking for stability when borrowing? A fixed rate home equity loan keeps your rate and payment constant for the duration of your loan. Terms of 5, 7, 10, and 15 years are available. Need a different term-length? Let\u2019s talk.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-light-orange-background-color has-background\"><strong>Home Equity Line of Credit (HELOC)<\/strong> \u2014 A HELOC lets you access the equity in your home for a variety of purposes. Enjoy almost 10 years of interest-only payments to purchase a vehicle, finance education expenses, complete home improvements or get money for any unexpected expense that may arise. Benefit from the flexibility of using the line when needed and paying it down at your desired pace. After the draw period, required principal and interest payments will keep you on track to repaying any outstanding balance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-6 wp-block-columns is-style-info-block-tall\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"505\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_HELOC_01.jpg\" alt=\"A man in a brown shirt uses an electric drill on the ground while a puppy watches\" class=\"wp-image-4414\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_HELOC_01.jpg 255w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB_RL_HELOC_01-151x300.jpg 151w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 255px) 100vw, 255px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Ready to get started with your loan?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re ready to get to see what a home equity loan can do for you, you can&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">apply online<\/a>, or come into any branch or reach out to any mortgage lender on our Residential Lending Team, below.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/rates\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CHECK RATES<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apply Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Residential Lending Team<\/h2>\n\n\n<section data-block_af0b4cf7b06da82261740b7382546247 class=\"team-member align\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n                      <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <div class=\"team-member-card\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/our-team\/marta-amor-baker\/\">\n      <img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top wp-post-image\" alt=\"Marta Amor-Baker\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"la